  "body": "Found by the review of PR #3388 (comment 7078474276). It is a read of the code. It is not confirmed by a run.\n\nPR #3388 fixes the Post dialog: the scrolled option rows keep a gap on the right, so that the floating scroll bar does not cover the checkboxes (#3384).\n\nThe Setup -> Post page draws the same rows. `post_script_options::section` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/setup_pages.rs:57`) draws inside the scroll area of `properties_body` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs:114`). That scroll area keeps no gap. When the page is taller than its area, the scroll bar can lie over the checkboxes at the right edge, and a click goes to the bar.\n\nNecessary work:\n1. Pin it with a test: a click on a post option checkbox of the Setup -> Post page toggles the value when the page scrolls.\n2. Keep the same gap as `post_dialog.rs` and `op_page.rs:75-83`, in one shared place if that is possible.\n\nRefs #3384\n",
